            "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2119320354275635200/vid/avc1/1206x812/qtFSzEOirTkaptjh.mp4?tag=29",
            "width": 1206
          }
        ],
        "name": "Benny Johnson",
        "text": "Dave Chappelle: “Ever since that guy Charlie Kirk got murdered, and I shouldn’t say this publicly but…. I feel better.”\n\nThis isn’t even comedy. It’s just sick…",
